        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“My parrots are odd ones”</strong> is a fun cryptography game with simple rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features eccentric parrots that don't just repeat what you say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their unique <strong>“obsessive algorithms”</strong> through word exchanges and befriend these colorful parrots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, out of the blue, an invitation to an event arrived from an organization with the somewhat unusual name of the Parrot Association.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/イベント招待状_表?t=1765504806\" /></span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/イベント招待状_裏?t=1765504806\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it's unclear, it seems quite a few eccentric parrots are waiting to talk with challengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite harboring doubts about what this is all about, you find yourself drawn to the oddball parrots and their peculiar obsessions, and head toward the event venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GamePlay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you speak to the parrots, they respond by transforming your words according to specific rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parrot has a distinct personality, and their word transformation rules come with unique quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through conversation, uncover their “obsessive algorithms” and get them to say the target word!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“My parrots are odd ones”</strong> is a fun cryptography game with simple rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features eccentric parrots that don't just repeat what you say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their unique <strong>“obsessive algorithms”</strong> through word exchanges and befriend these colorful parrots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, out of the blue, an invitation to an event arrived from an organization with the somewhat unusual name of the Parrot Association.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/イベント招待状_表?t=1765504806\" /></span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124840/extras/イベント招待状_裏?t=1765504806\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it's unclear, it seems quite a few eccentric parrots are waiting to talk with challengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite harboring doubts about what this is all about, you find yourself drawn to the oddball parrots and their peculiar obsessions, and head toward the event venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GamePlay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you speak to the parrots, they respond by transforming your words according to specific rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parrot has a distinct personality, and their word transformation rules come with unique quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through conversation, uncover their “obsessive algorithms” and get them to say the target word!</p>",
